# Browser control — no Firefox takeover

Do **not** launch, connect to, automate, or take over **Firefox** unless the
user has given clear, explicit consent in the current request (e.g. “use
Firefox” / “control Firefox”).

Default browsers for agent work: Cursor’s built-in browser tab, or Chrome /
Chromium only when the user asks for a real Chrome profile.

Silent or assumed use of Firefox is forbidden.
